== Research Interests
I am broadly interested in developing statistical methodology for causal inference and experimental designs, with particular emphasis on:
- Partial identification and sensitivity analysis
- Non-standard inference
- Distributionally robust optimization
- Design and analysis of randomized experiments

== News
- /Preprint/: [https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.23971 Causal Effects of Modified Treatment Policies under Positivity Violations: A Partial Identification Approach] on arXiv.
- /Preprint/: [https://arxiv.org/abs/2511.02632 Synthetic Control with Weight Uncertainty: Robust Identification and Statistical Inference] on arXiv.

